    LLM: 'Game: Briscola. Italian 40-card. Ranking: A(11)>3(10)>K(4)>Q(3)>J(2)>others(0). No follow-suit. Trump=Briscola. Target: 61 points.',
    Player: "Your opponent leads a mid-card Coin. You hold the Ace of Cups (Briscola, 11 pts) and the 3 of Coins (a 10-pt non-trump). Don't waste your Briscola Ace on this trickâ€”play the 3 of Coins. If they can't beat it, you win 0 pts on the trick but save your Ace for a bigger moment.",
    objective: 'Score 61 or more of the 120 available card points.',
    gameplay: 'Each trick: non-dealer leads any card. No follow-suit obligation. Opponent plays any card. Trick won by higher Briscola (trump) played, OR higher of led suit if no Briscola. Winner draws first from stock; loser draws second. Winner leads next. Final trick: trump indicator card is last taken from stock.',
